Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5dc95193-fd37-362e-84f0-1dd0e52b47c3.xml</text>
